So you have Etherpad installed and working? Now you want to allow users to have sub-domains and their own accounts? Maybe you want the privacy settings, I don't know...

First off: Got your * dns wildcard[1] in place? You are going to need it.

Then: Set up your smtp server[2]

Finally: Remove the need for SSL[3]

Oh yeah then:  Fix the sign in link[4]

